OL,3,AI'm a classic old school Conservative,
OL,4,Asays Kemi Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FKemi Badenoch has declared herself a
OL,7,F"classic old school Conservative" as
OL,8,Fshe begins her party's annual
OL,9,Fconference with a string of policy
OL,10,Fpledges and a 100 page statement on her
OL,11,Fguiding principles.
OL,13,F"I believe in common sense, people
OL,14,Fworking hard and being rewarded for
OL,15,Fthat effort," she told the BBC's Laura
OL,16,FKuenssberg.
OL,18,FShe added that welfare should be a
OL,19,F"safety net, not a lifestyle".
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
